                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Matt Spinler",
                        "email": "spinler@us.ibm.com",
                        "username": "spinler"
                    },
                    "message": "I feel like this whole topic needs a design doc, since it's a new concept and will touch several repos, including bmcweb/ipmi (I assume).  After that gets traction I'd be more willing to review new concepts in entity-manager."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
                    "line": 0,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "mahalakshmik-1",
                        "email": "mahalakshmik@ami.com",
                        "username": "mahalakshmik-1"
                    },
                    "message": "Thanks for the feedback. \nI have posted a design document that covers:\n\n- the new Battery configuration concept in entity-manager\n- runtime state evaluation/publication in dbus-sensors (batterystatus)\n- expected consumer model for bmcweb/IPMI (consume runtime objects, not raw EM config)\n- schema proposal, flow, impacts, and testing strategy"
                }
            ],
